[[Banana]]s are a type of [[Food]] which are used for health and stamina regeneration. It can be very useful in the early-game especially because [[Health Potion]]s and [[Heroic Potion]]s are not yet readily available at that stage. The [[Spicy Banana]] is a skill which specifically powers up [[Banana]]s, giving them a chance of giving [[Heat]]. The [[Spicy Banana]] also heals whenever a stamina is spent, rewarding the character for spending all of the stamina put out by their [[Banana]]s.

